<title>USA: ReliaStar completes PRIMEVEST acquisition.</title>
<headline>ReliaStar completes PRIMEVEST acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>ReliaStar Financial Corp said Thursday it completed the previously announced acquisition of PRIMEVEST Financial Services Inc from Kinnard Investments Inc.</p>
<p>Under terms of the agreement, ReliaStar paid Kinnard $15.5 million in cash for PRIMEVEST.</p>
<p>Kinnard previously said it would recognize a gain from the divestiture of about $1.08 per share in its fourth quarter earnings.</p>
<p>PRIMEVEST is a third-party marketing firm offering mutual funds, stocks and bonds. ReliaStar provides individual life insurance and annuities, mutual funds and retirement plans, among others.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
